     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PP401                     TEXT('POL PG END FORMS WORKFILE')
     A*
     A* KEY FIELDS
     A*
     A            P4XML         60A         COLHDG('XML FILE NAME')
     A*
     A            P4KEY          9S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('INCREMENTING' 'KEY')
     A*
     A*** BEGIN CHG ***  10/30/17  ****************************************
     A*********   P4FORM        18A
     A            P4FORM        25A
     A*** END CHG *****  10/30/17  ****************************************
